KEYSTROKES:
# Whole-year print for 2026 ("Key year, press B; press E" per the User
# Instructions above). Data entry (keying the year, pressing B) is left at
# regular speed and outside the elapsed-time measurement; only the actual
# print run (triggered by E) is timed, and run at full speed.
